### Chunking Strategy

| File Type | Strategy | Chunk Size |
|-----------|----------|-----------|
| Code files | Function/class boundaries (AST-aware) | ~500 tokens |
| Documents (PDF, DOCX) | Paragraph boundaries with overlap | ~400 tokens, 50 token overlap |
| Markdown | Section headers as boundaries | ~400 tokens |
| Research papers | Abstract, sections, references separated | ~500 tokens |
| CSV/Excel | Row groups with header context | ~300 tokens |
| Config files | Whole file (usually small) | Full file |

