| Task | Model | Trigger |
|------|-------|---------|
| Generate embeddings | `nomic-embed-text` (local) | On file index |
| Summarize file | `llama3.1:8b` or `phi3` (local) | On file index |
| Describe image | `llava:7b` or `moondream` (local) | On image index |
| Answer question | `llama3.1:8b` / Gemini (cloud, opt-in) | User query |
| Generate README | `llama3.1:8b` / Gemini | User request |
| Detect relationships | Rule-based + LLM | Post-indexing batch |
| Bug detection | `llama3.1:8b` / Gemini | User request |
| Resume generation | `llama3.1:8b` / Gemini | User request |

