## 12. Risks & Challenges

### Technical Risks

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-----------|
| **Ollama not installed / GPU unavailable** | AI features non-functional | Graceful degradation. Show clear setup wizard. Support CPU-only models (phi3-mini). Fall back to keyword search. |
| **Large workspaces (>100K files)** | Slow initial scan & high memory | Incremental scanning with priority queues. Stream results. Background indexing. Configurable depth limits. |
| **Embedding model quality on CPU** | Slow inference, poor search quality | Use quantized models. Batch embedding. Cache aggressively. Allow cloud embedding opt-in. |
| **PDF parsing complexity** | Scanned PDFs, complex layouts fail | Use OCR fallback (Tesseract via Rust binding). Skip unparseable pages gracefully. |
| **Tauri v2 maturity** | API changes, platform bugs | Pin Tauri version. Maintain abstraction layer over Tauri APIs. Active community support. |
| **SQLite concurrency** | Write contention during heavy indexing | WAL mode. Read-write separation. Queue writes through a dedicated writer task. |

### Product Risks

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|-----------|
| **User hardware variance** | Low-end machines can't run local LLM | Tiered model recommendations (tiny/small/medium). Cloud AI fallback. Features degrade gracefully. |
| **User trust (privacy)** | Users hesitant to grant folder access | Transparent permission model. Show exactly what is scanned. Never auto-scan. Allow fine-grained exclusions. |
| **Stale index** | Files change but index doesn't update | Real-time filesystem watcher. Background re-scan scheduler. Manual "Rescan" button. |
| **AI hallucinations** | Incorrect summaries or answers | Always cite source files. Show confidence indicators. Provide "Show sources" for every AI response. |

